rows-ambiguous-declaration = ambiguous effect-row declaration `{ $name }`
rows-captured-variable-needs-owner = the captured row variable `{ $var }` needs its lexical owner
rows-no-binder-identity = an effect row has no binder identity
rows-variable-no-owner = the row variable `{ $var }` has no lexical owner
rows-ambiguous-call = ambiguous lexical occurrence of an effect-row call
rows-call-no-owner = a call has no lexical effect-row owner
